          icon: '🌅',
          title: 'Exploring Annapurna Circuit',
          text: 'Begin your day at Annapurna Circuit early to beat the crowds and catch the best light. The trail is most atmospheric in the morning when the air is cool and the landscape catches the first golden rays. Take time to explore the main highlights and capture photographs in the soft morning light. This is the most rewarding time to visit.',
